      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RADIO RAMSGATE (4) was in traffic and missed the frame in a Grade 4/5 at this track over 300m latest, finishing a 2.75 lengths fourth (17.51). Has Box 4 this time where she has a win. Has the ability and can bounce back. WYVERN (1) ran seventh in a Grade 6 last time, copping a check in the run and finishing 12 lengths from the winner over 275m at Cannington. Has two wins from Box 1. Key chance on best form. TRUNKEY MISS (3) produced a moderate performance last time when fifth at this track over 400m behind West On Pash (23.12) in a Grade 5. Was a winner at her only start from this draw. One of the better chances. DID IT HAPPEN (2) is worth a look over a shorter trip this time.",
